{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.mp4?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share the Burden, Share the Chaos!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 players</strong> - Grab a  friend and some controllers, you'll have to work together to achieve objectives! Perfect for parties and game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Angel, 4 Wings</strong>\u00a0- Each player controls one wing, but you all share a single body. OUR body. Communication is key\u2014good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Deadly Sins - </strong>Choose a wing inspired by the seven deadly sins. Each one comes with its own strengths and weaknesses\u2014some complement, others clash. Can you make it work?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/6b4584548555ab8e3b536030fc551fdf.mp4?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ADVENTURE MODE]</strong> Stairway to heaven, or highway to hell. <strong>Your destiny awaits.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stripped of your grace and cast into purgatory, you face a monumental choice: <strong>ascend 10,000 meters</strong> of treacherous obstacles on the Stairway to Heaven to reclaim your place, or descend <strong>10,000 meters down</strong> the perilous Highway to Hell in search of\u2026 something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Begin your journey in the murky depths and commit to your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/1017212d03e546bc36f35528e6161c01.mp4?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ARCADE MODE]</strong> Several Ways To Win. Find Them All!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperating is a must - </strong>Kaz can't get anywhere with one wing. Collecting halos can get Kaz back to heaven!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competing is inevitable\u00a0</strong>- Only one wing can pick up halos and evil essences. The more each player picks up, the stronger their influence over Kazfiel gets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/64843ff878b77d05762b086b1b6e1d34.mp4?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The controls are simple:</strong> flap your wings, navigate the chaos, and work (or fight) with your teammates. Whether you\u2019re playing couch co-op or online, Haphazard Angel delivers the perfect mix of fun and frustration!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2363160?t=1758910016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758910016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/46545453ea859b5b61f3da314212595063dd4111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758910016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/46545453ea859b5b61f3da314212595063dd4111/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758910016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3389360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/90bfe78b859c84b0b3906f9fff4337b2.mp4?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I'm Kazfiel Balthioul Tabbris.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, <strong>Kaz!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game where being an asshole to your friends <strong>is actually a good thing!</strong>\u00a0In Haphazard Angel, 2-4 players take on the hilariously challenging task of controlling a single, magnificent <i>(and often unwieldy)</i> angel. You each control one of its four glorious wings, meaning teamwork is essential... <strong>until it isn't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.poster.avif?t=1758910016\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363160/extras/3efec1391afbb85683219204b4385306.webm?t=1758910016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share the Burden, Share the Chaos!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-4 players</strong> - Grab a  friend and some controllers, you'll have to work together to achieve objectives! Perfect for parties and game nights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 Angel, 4 Wings</strong>\u00a0- Each player controls one wing, but you all share a single body. OUR body. Communication is key\u2014good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Deadly Sins - </strong>Choose a wing inspired by the seven deadly sins. Each one comes with its own strengths and weaknesses\u2014some complement, others clash. Can you make it work?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st